cmo94p4810083nj9jj87vb62z	cmo94ovyp007vnj9jawf95k0k	AI	\N	G'day Vlad! Booking with Scootering is easy:\n\n1. **Visit our pricing page** at scootering.com.au/pricing to see live availability and get a quote for your dates.\n2. **Select your scooter** — we have 50cc through to 300cc Maxi models.\n3. **Choose your dates & depot** — Gold Coast, Byron Bay, or Noosa Heads.\n4. **Complete your booking** — you'll need a valid licence with at least 6 months remaining, and you must be 18+.\n5. **Pay the hire fee** — we'll also hold a security deposit as a pre-authorisation on your card.\n\n**Licence tip:** 50cc requires a car licence (C class) in QLD, but RE motorbike licence in NSW. 100cc+ needs RE or full R licence depending on engine size.\n\nNeed help picking a scooter or have questions about availability? Happy to help!	\N	\N	f	2026-04-21 21:21:12.097
